stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNREGISTERED

    UNREGISTERED --> WORKER_PENDING: PROC_AUTH_HELLO (IP, RAM, SHA-256(PSK)) - master sends nonce & seed
    WORKER_PENDING --> WORKER_ACTIVE: PROC_CAP_ACK (HMAC proof & seeded RAM checksum) - master verifies & stitches ring

    WORKER_ACTIVE --> WORKER_ACTIVE: PROC_HEARTBEAT each 200 ticks (20 s) - master polls each 5000 ms

    WORKER_ACTIVE --> WORKER_SUSPECTED: age exceeds 400 ticks (40 s)
    WORKER_PENDING --> WORKER_SUSPECTED: age exceeds 400 ticks (40 s), soft-state aging
    WORKER_SUSPECTED --> WORKER_ACTIVE: PROC_HEARTBEAT received

    WORKER_ACTIVE --> WORKER_EXPIRED: age exceeds 800 ticks (80 s) - master sends PROC_EVICT
    WORKER_PENDING --> WORKER_EXPIRED: age exceeds 800 ticks (80 s) - master sends PROC_EVICT
    WORKER_SUSPECTED --> WORKER_EXPIRED: age exceeds 800 ticks (80 s) - master sends PROC_EVICT

    WORKER_EXPIRED --> WORKER_PENDING: PROC_EVICT received - re-register via PROC_AUTH_HELLO
